A||||13||fierosound||Hypertech vs ADS vs Fastchip - which is best?||||5||
Z||000000||fierosound||12-15-1999||05:32 PM||||I've ben running a Hypertech chip (w/160 thermostat) since I bought my car, and it's been very good.  At the time, the only other performance chip was the ADS, and it had a bad reputation for screwing up your idle, and not working as well as advertised.  Hypertech was considered superior.<P>Now, there is also Fastchip ( <A HREF="http://www.fastchip.com/" TARGET=_blank>www.fastchip.com/</A>  ) performance chips.  Is anyone running with one of these?  Has anyone had a chance to compare these to ADS of Hyperchip for the Fiero??||||reg||5
Z||000001||superXmotorsports||12-15-1999||09:10 PM||||I have always used the Hypertech thermomaster chips.  I used ADS once and it was OK too.  The ADS costs alot less.  I didn't know there was anyone else making chips - I'll have to check them out.  SXM.||||reg||1
Z||000002||fierosound||12-17-1999||12:30 AM||||I've been doing more checking, and have heard that HyperTech chips only give you power at WOT, otherwise function as stock. I've also come across this quote in a Camaro Forum:<P>"I once used a Hypertech Stage 2 Chip. From Day one I noticed nothing and was very unhappy. Recently I switched to a FastChip from Ed Wright and it is a HUGE difference. FASTCHIP is superior and noticeable. I will get your track results ASAP. I will do runs with both chips and race my buddy who is now runing my Hypertech Chip, Poor Sucker!!!!!!"<P><BR>There are also 2 other chip manufacturers I've found:<P><BR>SuperChips - <A HREF="http://www.superchips.com/gmc.htm" TARGET=_blank>www.superchips.com/gmc.htm</A> <BR>Though they don't have chips for Fieros, but have a chip for  Cavalier Z24, Baretta or Corsica, Olds Quad 4, and Chev Z34.  These may work?<P>JET Performance chips - <A HREF="http://www.jetchip.com/domestic/" TARGET=_blank>www.jetchip.com/domestic </A> <BR>Have performance PROM chips for Fiero, programmable ignition computer and air/fuel monitor kit.  They are definitely performance oriented.<P><BR>So now there a choice of 5 chips:<P>ADS - Hypertech - Fastchip - SuperChip - JET Chip <P><BR>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 12-21-1999).]<p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 12-21-1999).]||||reg||10
