Z||000011||Bruce||12-22-1999||04:17 PM|||| I have the ADS chip, which I bought shortly after I purchased my Fiero. I don't notice a significant difference, but I haven't changed my thermostat to a lower rating, either. The 180 degree that I want always seems to be out of stock. But, i'm on vaction now, so maybe I'll shop around a little more vigorously.<BR> It's a great feeling, particularly in the spirit of the season, that there's a place with so much friendship and good will as this forum.||||reg||1
Z||000012||Bruce||12-22-1999||04:17 PM|||| I have the ADS chip, which I bought shortly after I purchased my Fiero. I don't notice a significant difference, but I haven't changed my thermostat to a lower rating, either. The 180 degree that I want always seems to be out of stock. But, i'm on vaction now, so maybe I'll shop around a little more vigorously.<BR> It's a great feeling, particularly in the spirit of the season, that there's a place with so much friendship and good will as this forum.||||reg||1
