Z||000014||fierosound||01-03-2000||03:01 PM||||I've found another manufacturer of performance computer chips.<P><BR>Performance Resource ( <A HREF="http://www.performanceresource.com/acatalog/Online_Catalog_Car_E__Proms_Modules____computer_chips___1.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.performanceresource.com/acatalog/Online_Catalog_Car_E__Proms_Modules____computer_chips___1.html</A>  )<BR>also has Fiero V6 chips.<BR>||||reg||10
